{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-152259","model_call":36,"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2367"},"record":{"query":{"op":"next","qid":"q2367"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_1595724340#2_3301623748","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2367","rank":2,"snippet":"Heights “Heathcliff it’s me, Cathy, I’ve come home and I’m so cold…” Darkness ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Passion ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Lyrics ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Originality ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Story ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Magic ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ 1. The Cure – Lovesong “Whenever I’m alone with you, you make me feel like I am whole again”<cover>Darkness ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Passion ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Lyrics ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Originality ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Story ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Magic ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ ♦ Fun Facts! Country Countdown! Marloes Valentina Stella \" , \"segment\": \"This list is thus not limited to goth artists or goth rock </cover>alone; it also features gothic metal and mixed or related genres (doom/symphonic/black). There are even a few songs made by pop artists. What makes a Good Gothic Love Song? So, what are the components of a good gothic love song? I named 6 factors that I believe are often present in a good gothic music: 1) darkness, the ‘goth feel’; 2) passion, including fatal love; 3) lyrics, ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_1595724340#2_3301623748","rank":2,"relevance":1}]},"time":8},"model_calls":36,"document_judgments":27,"relevance_3":3,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
